## ✅ Final Instruction to Append

```
After listing all schemas, add a short "Collection Count Summary" section:
- Total top-level collections used (aim to justify a number roughly in the 8-11 range
  for this entire platform, not 20+).
- One line per collection stating why it is standalone rather than embedded.
Also add a "Suggested Indexes" section listing compound indexes recommended for the
top 3 highest-traffic query patterns (user login, swipe/match lookup, chat pagination).
```

